<title>UK: London gold fixes touch easier, consolidates.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes touch easier, consolidates.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $317.60 down 40 cents from previously. Some selling in Asia believed to be on producer basis. Strong dollar discouraging buyers. May consolidate today.</p>
<p>SILVER - Weaker at $4.24/$4.26 down 20 cents. Stops taken out. Could weaken further to test $4.00.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also off at $405.00/$408.00, down about $5.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $7.70 at $174.00/$177.00.</p>
</text>
